    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">smoke, unit</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GPIO driver/HAL, board init scripts</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">make run TEST=gpio_reg_wr_rd_test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Program and read back registers; compare to expected masks/reset values.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All register writes are readable and hold expected values post write.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GPIO_DATA, GPIO_DIR, GPIO_OUT_EN, GPIO_DEBOUNCE, GPIO_INTR_EN, GPIO_INTR_TYPE, GPIO_INTR_POL</Data></Cell>
