    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GPIO ISR, interrupt controller config, HAL</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">make run TEST=test_gpio_negedge_intr_en</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Configure pin as input; enable interrupt; drive high-to-low edge; service ISR.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Interrupt triggers exactly once per falling edge; status/clear sequence works.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GPIO_INTR_EN, GPIO_INTR_TYPE, GPIO_INTR_POL, GPIO_INTR_STATUS</Data></Cell>
